# A race with a controller pak (a fresh, formatted one: port/ultra/si.c): the pak warning finds it, and the game's
# save code (the profiles, the records, SaveServer and SaveFlush at the race's start and end) runs on it
# (docs/port/SYNTH.md 2).
# until: 0x400000:300
# seconds: 90
# args: --pak pak.mpk
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 0, track 0
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
17 A           # the mode screen
20 A           # the track select
23 A           # the car select
